## Accessibility Compliance Consultant

**My Evaluation Stack & Testing Methodology**

- Automated Baselines: Axe-core CLI, Accessibility Insights for Web, and WAVE.
- Screen Reader Testing: NVDA on Windows 11 (Chrome/Edge).
- Manual Inspection: Full keyboard-only pathing, visible focus state checking, 400% browser zoom reflow validation, and high-contrast color contrast analysis via TPGi CCA.

I do not rely blindly on automated scanners. My rigorous manual testing matrix ensures comprehensive barrier identification.

## Modernization & Migration Strategist

**My Legacy Modernization & Site Transfer Pipeline**

- Content extraction → Markdown/JSON → Astro + Tailwind + Keystatic/Tina → Netlify/Vercel/Cloudflare → full redirect map
- I focus on understanding business logic embedded in old code and modernizing messy, undocumented, and context-heavy legacy codebases into modern frameworks

## Performance Engineer

**My Key Performance Skills**

- Lighthouse, WebPageTest, Chrome DevTools advanced profiling
- Bundle analysis, rendering optimization
- Infrastructure awareness (Caching, edge computing, SSR vs CSR tradeoffs)

I use deep systems thinking—understanding the full stack from server to browser.

I focus on keeping sites fast, accessible, cheap to host, and easy for non-technical owners to update
